  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Samoa Bilateral Security and Governance Activity 2025-2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will be designed to be implemented over five years - 2025- 2030.
It will assist in strengthening&#xA0;Samoa&apos;s security and governance needs, as identified by Samoa.
There are several components to the Activity, including&#xA0;implementing&#xA0;a bilateral police&#xA0;activity, (following co-design) and providing&#xA0;capacity and capability support to the&#xA0;Office of the Attorney General in Samoa. Initially&#xA0;this support will be legislative drafting and mentoring but will expand to other initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
